  "dup": "---\ndispatch: auto\ndispatch: auto\n---\n",
  "issue-work": "---\ntask: issue-work\nmodel: deepseek-flash\nharness: forge   # h\nbudget_usd: 2.00\ndispatch: auto\n---\nwork the issue\n"
